1
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:14,973
We need to get them!
Follow them! Catch them!

2
00:00:15,056 --> 00:00:16,141
Get away!

3
00:00:17,017 --> 00:00:20,687
This is Ranma of the Saotome
School of Anything Goes Martial Arts.

4
00:00:23,523 --> 00:00:25,817
And this is Akane of the Tendo Dojo.

5
00:00:26,985 --> 00:00:29,821
These two teens were arranged
to be married by their parents.

6
00:00:29,904 --> 00:00:31,072
- Huh?
- Huh?

7
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:32,615
My fate is my own!

8
00:00:32,699 --> 00:00:34,576
What a nuisance you are!

9
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:38,538
Unfortunately Ranma has
a bit of a problem.

10
00:00:40,582 --> 00:00:43,835
When splashed with cold water,
he transforms into a girl.

11
00:00:43,918 --> 00:00:45,295
What the hell was that for?

12
00:00:47,255 --> 00:00:48,381
Get back here!

13
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:57,557
RANMA1/2

14
00:02:25,311 --> 00:02:27,897
Ladies and gentlemen,
thank you so much for your patience...

15
00:02:28,982 --> 00:02:30,775
...I'd apologize
but we know that's the way it is.

16
00:02:30,859 --> 00:02:35,071
A scorching flower blooms feverishly
amid the freezing winds of the ice rink,

17
00:02:35,155 --> 00:02:38,783
caught between red-hot passion
and chilly composure.

18
00:02:38,867 --> 00:02:41,536
Flying, turning, gliding,
slipping, sliding,

19
00:02:41,619 --> 00:02:43,997
the bloom is the one and only
Daydream Flower,

20
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:46,749
better known to pop-song lovers
as musobana.

21
00:02:46,833 --> 00:02:49,460
These young skaters are competing
to the bitter end

22
00:02:49,544 --> 00:02:52,422
to try and grasp that dream of victory,
the Charlotte Cup!

23
00:02:52,505 --> 00:02:55,133
Through heaven and earth,
I alone will dare to forge

24
00:02:55,216 --> 00:02:58,011
toward an unparalleled event
for the first, and possibly last, time.

25
00:02:58,094 --> 00:03:01,556
Unheard, unsung, un-ionized,
my two cents make no sense at all.

26
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:04,100
I pity the fool that doesn't realize
the balcony is closed,

27
00:03:04,184 --> 00:03:05,727
but knowing is half the battle.

28
00:03:05,810 --> 00:03:08,229
When I've fallen and I can't get up,
na-noo, na-noo.

29
00:03:08,313 --> 00:03:12,233
Do tears of glory await them at the end
of these trials and tribulations?

30
00:03:12,317 --> 00:03:15,945
Who will brush aside
the Goddess of Victory's glorious bangs

31
00:03:16,029 --> 00:03:17,989
like a modern-day Alexander Nevsky?

32
00:03:18,072 --> 00:03:21,201
I don't want you to take your eyes
off this match for a single moment.

33
00:03:21,284 --> 00:03:24,204
Even a glance away
could cost you precious details!

34
00:03:24,704 --> 00:03:27,457
Well, I've kept the audience waiting
long enough.

35
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:30,877
The final arc of this
Martial Skating maelstrom begins!

36
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:34,464
It's time to witness the clash
of two great rivals!

37
00:03:36,674 --> 00:03:39,636
And now,
our unprecedented match continues.

38
00:03:39,719 --> 00:03:41,304
It's the Martial Skating showdown

39
00:03:41,387 --> 00:03:44,098
between Kolkhoz High School
and Furinkan High School.

40
00:03:44,182 --> 00:03:47,227
The ice cracks that remain in the rink
look like Antarctica.

41
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:51,022
With a fresh new pair switched in
to represent Furinkan High School,

42
00:03:51,105 --> 00:03:52,857
the match begins with a new fire.

43
00:03:53,816 --> 00:03:56,611
Ranma, Ryoga, do your best out there.

44
00:03:56,694 --> 00:03:58,613
Bring it on, Sanzenin.

45
00:03:58,696 --> 00:03:59,697
Prepare yourself!

46
00:04:03,451 --> 00:04:04,869
Come on, Charlotte.

47
00:04:04,953 --> 00:04:08,373
You need to give up and accept that
the two of us are going home together.

48
00:04:08,998 --> 00:04:12,502
You, with the pigtail. To me.
Fall right into my arms.

49
00:04:12,585 --> 00:04:15,755
Yeah. Just try
and catch this flight if you can!

50
00:04:18,591 --> 00:04:22,011
Crap, I forgot I was as banged up as I am.

51
00:04:23,596 --> 00:04:25,890
Now, what's gotten you so upset?

52
00:04:25,974 --> 00:04:28,476
I would have thought
you'd be happy to receive a kiss from me.

53
00:04:28,559 --> 00:04:30,395
I don't want a kiss from a weirdo!

54
00:04:30,478 --> 00:04:32,522
I don't give a crap who you think you are.

55
00:04:32,605 --> 00:04:34,565
Try anything again and you're dead!

56
00:04:34,649 --> 00:04:37,986
I see. If that's how you feel...

57
00:04:38,569 --> 00:04:39,612
Mmm?

58
00:04:39,696 --> 00:04:41,990
You must be feeling jealous
of Akane Tendo.

59
00:04:42,073 --> 00:04:43,074
Huh?

60
00:04:43,825 --> 00:04:46,035
It'll be okay. No need to worry.

61
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:50,999
My special skill allows me to love
every woman in equal measure.

62
00:04:51,582 --> 00:04:54,711
And my dear, my love for you is
deeper than the ocean.

63
00:04:54,794 --> 00:04:56,879
Oh, cute!

64
00:04:58,464 --> 00:04:59,799
No way!

65
00:04:59,882 --> 00:05:03,720
I cannot begin to overstate
how deluded you are.

66
00:05:08,599 --> 00:05:09,600
Don't you get it?

67
00:05:09,684 --> 00:05:12,020
How many times do I have to tell you
I'm not Charlotte?

68
00:05:12,103 --> 00:05:16,149
Oh? You're not? Well do you have any idea
where Charlotte might be?

69
00:05:16,232 --> 00:05:18,526
- I l-let it go back in the wild.
- Huh?

70
00:05:19,444 --> 00:05:22,572
I felt sorry that it was being forced
to go along with this.

71
00:05:22,655 --> 00:05:25,616
It gave me this collar as a parting gift
before it left.

72
00:05:25,700 --> 00:05:27,160
So please, just give this up.

73
00:05:29,245 --> 00:05:30,538
Whoa.

74
00:05:31,164 --> 00:05:32,707
You gotta give me some warning!

75
00:05:32,790 --> 00:05:33,624
Hmm?

76
00:05:36,127 --> 00:05:38,212
Oh, no. Did I make you cry?

77
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:40,757
- Give it back now.
- Huh?

78
00:05:43,217 --> 00:05:49,640
Give me back my Charlotte!

79
00:05:49,724 --> 00:05:51,642
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

80
00:05:51,726 --> 00:05:54,145
Give it back! Give it back! Give it back!
Give it back!

81
00:06:01,152 --> 00:06:02,653
How is she that strong?

82
00:06:02,737 --> 00:06:05,114
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

83
00:06:05,198 --> 00:06:06,366
Shut your mouth!

84
00:06:06,449 --> 00:06:09,494
You're one to talk, when you're sporting
a huge lump on the back of your head.

85
00:06:09,577 --> 00:06:11,245
- Hmm?
- The nerve.

86
00:06:11,329 --> 00:06:12,413
Ow!

87
00:06:13,039 --> 00:06:15,166
Whatever. We still need
to come up with a plan.

88
00:06:15,249 --> 00:06:16,292
A plan?

89
00:06:16,376 --> 00:06:18,711
I don't want to,
but we gotta work together.

90
00:06:18,795 --> 00:06:21,589
Ugh! No, we don't.

91
00:06:21,672 --> 00:06:24,008
We might be paired up
but I'm not going to work with you.

92
00:06:24,092 --> 00:06:26,386
You just got
your ass handed to you!

93
00:06:26,469 --> 00:06:28,262
Look, I'm pretty beat-up too.

94
00:06:29,931 --> 00:06:32,308
We have to prioritize winning
right now.

95
00:06:33,476 --> 00:06:35,144
Listen to me, Ryoga.

96
00:06:35,228 --> 00:06:36,646
Fine. Out with it.

97
00:06:37,897 --> 00:06:40,608
Oh, hang on. What could be going on now?

98
00:06:40,691 --> 00:06:43,778
The pair from Furinkan High School
seems to be deep in conversation.

99
00:06:43,861 --> 00:06:47,073
So is it possible we're about to witness
a change in the duo's plan of attack?

100
00:06:47,156 --> 00:06:49,075
What? How could you say that?

101
00:06:49,158 --> 00:06:51,577
You're just a big bully.

102
00:06:52,870 --> 00:06:55,498
So, what? Am I not good enough
for you anymore?

103
00:06:55,581 --> 00:06:57,291
- Are you serious?
- You're a bully.

104
00:06:57,375 --> 00:07:00,002
Nothing but a pig-headed low-down
insensitive bully.

105
00:07:00,086 --> 00:07:01,838
Where do you get off
saying that to me?

106
00:07:01,921 --> 00:07:03,297
What is this?

107
00:07:03,381 --> 00:07:06,426
Why are you always so violent?
You awful, feral shrew!

108
00:07:06,509 --> 00:07:08,719
You and I are done. Good day!

109
00:07:15,393 --> 00:07:18,646
Why is it
I so often find myself alone?

110
00:07:22,984 --> 00:07:25,987
I guess he's the only one
who truly loves me.

111
00:07:28,990 --> 00:07:31,742
At long last she understands.

112
00:07:31,826 --> 00:07:33,786
My pigtailed beauty.

113
00:07:34,912 --> 00:07:37,540
Here I come, to cradle you in consolation.

114
00:07:42,587 --> 00:07:45,047
Darling. You're not hurt, are you?

115
00:07:45,131 --> 00:07:47,341
It's really you, my beloved!

116
00:07:47,425 --> 00:07:49,427
- Just kidding!
- Whoa!

117
00:07:50,386 --> 00:07:51,846
Tricky minx.

118
00:07:52,472 --> 00:07:53,764
Thanks for the help.

119
00:07:55,308 --> 00:07:56,684
No! San-chan!

120
00:07:59,812 --> 00:08:01,731
Time to pay you back for earlier.

121
00:08:01,814 --> 00:08:03,232
So prepare yourself.

122
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:05,818
I'm just a little baby.

123
00:08:05,902 --> 00:08:08,863
Could you two live with yourselves
if you bullied me?

124
00:08:08,946 --> 00:08:10,698
You're just a couple of cowards.

125
00:08:11,365 --> 00:08:13,117
Yeah, she does have a point.

126
00:08:18,456 --> 00:08:21,626
Ah, that was close.

127
00:08:21,709 --> 00:08:23,628
I didn't think you would play that dirty.

128
00:08:23,711 --> 00:08:26,255
- Scary!
- Whoa!

129
00:08:26,339 --> 00:08:29,759
You may be a girl,
but a match is a match! Sorry.

130
00:08:30,635 --> 00:08:31,636
Ow.

131
00:08:34,722 --> 00:08:36,682
It hurts!

132
00:08:39,977 --> 00:08:41,354
Oh, incredible!

133
00:08:41,437 --> 00:08:44,232
A remarkable showcase of teamwork
from Furinkan High!

134
00:08:44,315 --> 00:08:47,318
Oh, wow! Well done, you two!

135
00:08:50,821 --> 00:08:53,491
Akane went out of her way
to congratulate me.

136
00:08:53,574 --> 00:08:55,117
The two of us, you mean.

137
00:08:55,201 --> 00:08:56,911
No, me.

138
00:08:56,994 --> 00:08:58,037
Both of us.

139
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,497
To me.

140
00:08:59,580 --> 00:09:01,916
It's too early for you guys to celebrate.

141
00:09:01,999 --> 00:09:03,793
When did they get up?

142
00:09:03,876 --> 00:09:07,255
Well if that's how you wanted to play
this, we'll have to bring our A-game.

143
00:09:07,338 --> 00:09:09,423
Can't admit when you're beat.

144
00:09:09,924 --> 00:09:11,676
Just watch what I can do, Akane.

145
00:09:12,301 --> 00:09:13,970
- Here I go--
- Hold it right there.

146
00:09:16,556 --> 00:09:17,557
What are you doing?

147
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:19,100
You're not winning this thing on your own.

148
00:09:19,183 --> 00:09:21,060
You two need to pay attention!

149
00:09:21,143 --> 00:09:22,937
Huh?

150
00:09:23,020 --> 00:09:25,022
Doth mine eyes deceive me?

151
00:09:25,106 --> 00:09:26,274
Are they curling?

152
00:09:27,149 --> 00:09:29,860
Oh! An amazing double whammy!

153
00:09:30,861 --> 00:09:32,697
Seriously, what is going on here?

154
00:09:34,532 --> 00:09:37,326
It's all your fault!
You shouldn't have gotten in my way.

155
00:09:37,410 --> 00:09:38,578
Ah, shut up already.

156
00:09:38,661 --> 00:09:41,622
- What?
- You're only trying to show off for Akane.

157
00:09:41,706 --> 00:09:42,999
Stop messing this up for me.

158
00:09:43,082 --> 00:09:45,459
This is why
you're never gonna be able to beat me.

159
00:09:47,628 --> 00:09:49,964
This is why
you're never gonna be able to beat me.

160
00:09:50,047 --> 00:09:51,841
You're never gonna be able to beat me.

161
00:09:51,924 --> 00:09:53,718
Never gonna be able to beat me.

162
00:09:53,801 --> 00:09:55,803
Never gonna be able to beat me.

163
00:09:58,764 --> 00:10:00,141
Are you even listening?

164
00:10:00,224 --> 00:10:01,892
Uh, hello?

165
00:10:03,019 --> 00:10:06,897
Very well. Let's take a moment
to finally settle this here and now.

166
00:10:06,981 --> 00:10:07,857
Huh?

167
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:10,109
Whoa!

168
00:10:10,192 --> 00:10:12,320
Pay attention!

169
00:10:12,403 --> 00:10:14,322
I know which of us is better for her.

170
00:10:14,822 --> 00:10:16,449
And it's me!

171
00:10:18,284 --> 00:10:21,245
Ha! You fell for it! Now's my chance!

172
00:10:21,329 --> 00:10:24,332
Ah! He's gone and locked into
a German suplex!

173
00:10:24,415 --> 00:10:26,459
This is intense!

174
00:10:29,378 --> 00:10:31,213
That could've been bad.

175
00:10:37,178 --> 00:10:39,513
Give me back my Charlotte!

176
00:10:41,891 --> 00:10:43,434
Hmm?

177
00:10:46,270 --> 00:10:47,438
I'm ending this!

178
00:10:47,521 --> 00:10:48,397
Huh?

179
00:10:48,481 --> 00:10:49,649
Ha!

180
00:10:51,734 --> 00:10:54,153
Akane, please, give me strength!

181
00:11:05,456 --> 00:11:07,124
Whoa!

182
00:11:32,775 --> 00:11:33,776
I won.

183
00:11:35,027 --> 00:11:37,405
Wow! You are amazing!

184
00:11:37,488 --> 00:11:40,116
Is this really the end
for Mikado Sanzenin?

185
00:11:40,199 --> 00:11:42,451
Has Kolkhoz High School been knocked out?

186
00:11:42,535 --> 00:11:43,577
San-chan.

187
00:11:45,079 --> 00:11:46,831
This blanket is so cute!

188
00:11:47,331 --> 00:11:49,208
Don't you take my blanket, you wench!

189
00:11:49,291 --> 00:11:52,586
- Hey, just let it go!
- I should be saying the same thing!

190
00:11:52,670 --> 00:11:55,923
You shouldn't be hogging Martine!

191
00:11:56,507 --> 00:11:59,552
I love you, Martine.

192
00:11:59,635 --> 00:12:02,596
Hmm, yeah, he's been knocked out.

193
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:06,809
The winner, Furinkan High School!

194
00:12:07,643 --> 00:12:11,981
Knockout! Kolkhoz's golden pair
accept the bitter taste of defeat.

195
00:12:12,064 --> 00:12:14,150
The victory goes to Furinkan High School!

196
00:12:14,817 --> 00:12:16,944
I won for you, Akane.

197
00:12:20,531 --> 00:12:23,367
This isn't over yet,
you hear me?

198
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:28,539
You never know when to give up,
do you, Ranma?

199
00:12:29,248 --> 00:12:31,751
I must admit, I admire your tenacity,

200
00:12:32,877 --> 00:12:35,337
but Akane is mine to claim!

201
00:12:35,838 --> 00:12:37,965
You get that she's not a cat, right?

202
00:12:38,048 --> 00:12:40,301
It's not like I can
just hand her over to you.

203
00:12:40,384 --> 00:12:42,303
Hyah!

204
00:12:46,682 --> 00:12:48,017
Now knock it off!

205
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:50,603
And get your head
back in the game, you idiot.

206
00:12:50,686 --> 00:12:54,148
I can't just leave Akane alone.
Not with a half-assed jerk like you.

207
00:12:54,857 --> 00:12:56,859
It's still better than being with a pig!

208
00:12:57,485 --> 00:12:59,361
I'm done playing the nice guy!

209
00:13:01,947 --> 00:13:04,617
You can go to hell, nice guy!

210
00:13:08,454 --> 00:13:10,164
Ugh! Both of you need to cut it out!

211
00:13:10,247 --> 00:13:12,208
- Wh...
- What the hell was that for, Akane?

212
00:13:12,291 --> 00:13:14,960
Why is it that you two are
always at each other's throats?

213
00:13:15,044 --> 00:13:17,546
Oh, shut up! You should keep your nose
out of this!

214
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:19,131
So there is something then.

215
00:13:19,215 --> 00:13:20,925
You have to tell me what's going on.

216
00:13:21,008 --> 00:13:22,927
Why do the two of you keep picking
at each other?

217
00:13:23,552 --> 00:13:25,137
Because I have to beat Ryoga--

218
00:13:25,221 --> 00:13:27,431
We can sit down and have
a long conversation about this later.

219
00:13:27,515 --> 00:13:28,933
Get off me!

220
00:13:29,016 --> 00:13:30,434
What do you even have to talk about?

221
00:13:30,518 --> 00:13:32,770
- I don't wanna hear it from you.
- Hey, come on!

222
00:13:32,853 --> 00:13:34,396
Quit squealing, you nasty pig!

223
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:35,689
I'll end you if I have to!

224
00:13:35,773 --> 00:13:37,691
- What's that?
- I already told you to stop!

225
00:13:37,775 --> 00:13:39,443
Now's my chance!

226
00:13:48,077 --> 00:13:49,787
No. Akane!

227
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:51,747
Geez. That's why I said to butt out.

228
00:13:55,501 --> 00:13:56,502
Oh, no.

229
00:13:56,585 --> 00:13:57,670
She doesn't know how to swim?

230
00:13:57,753 --> 00:13:59,505
- Akane!
- Akane!

231
00:14:00,089 --> 00:14:01,298
Huh? Dude.

232
00:14:01,382 --> 00:14:02,591
What do you want?

233
00:14:02,675 --> 00:14:03,676
You good?

234
00:14:15,771 --> 00:14:19,483
Akane!

235
00:14:27,616 --> 00:14:29,326
Huh?

236
00:14:30,703 --> 00:14:32,204
Oh! Good, you're awake.

237
00:14:32,288 --> 00:14:33,414
Are you okay?

238
00:14:33,497 --> 00:14:35,249
Yeah. I, uh...

239
00:14:35,332 --> 00:14:36,333
Huh?

240
00:14:37,585 --> 00:14:39,128
Ranma?

241
00:14:39,211 --> 00:14:40,212
Heads up.

242
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,214
What happened?

243
00:14:42,798 --> 00:14:44,425
And why is P-chan all wet too?

244
00:14:45,593 --> 00:14:48,679
Brave boy. He bit you and dragged you
over to safety.

245
00:14:48,762 --> 00:14:50,681
We have no idea how he could've jumped in.

246
00:14:51,181 --> 00:14:52,266
I see.

247
00:14:53,100 --> 00:14:54,643
Thank you so much, P-chan.

248
00:14:56,729 --> 00:14:59,565
You should thank Ryoga too.

249
00:14:59,648 --> 00:15:02,443
He was the first person
to try and jump in to save you.

250
00:15:02,526 --> 00:15:04,570
Oh, yeah, where did he run off to?

251
00:15:04,653 --> 00:15:05,905
He hasn't gotten back yet?

252
00:15:06,697 --> 00:15:09,992
Well, in light of all
the stupid crap you kept pulling today,

253
00:15:10,075 --> 00:15:11,744
why don't we just call it a draw?

254
00:15:11,827 --> 00:15:13,162
Oh?

255
00:15:15,205 --> 00:15:16,290
Huh?

256
00:15:31,263 --> 00:15:32,848
Shampoo!

257
00:15:32,932 --> 00:15:34,642
Ranma, you're dead.

258
00:15:39,188 --> 00:15:40,856
Ranma, you're dead.

259
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:42,399
Shampoo.

260
00:15:43,275 --> 00:15:44,443
I'll kill you!

261
00:15:47,863 --> 00:15:49,657
Um, what's going on?

262
00:15:49,740 --> 00:15:50,741
It's all right.

263
00:15:51,325 --> 00:15:53,285
I thought I was done with you.

264
00:15:53,369 --> 00:15:54,620
Go away already!

265
00:15:57,414 --> 00:15:59,249
- Ranma?
- Went that way.

266
00:16:03,504 --> 00:16:04,463
Ugh! Damn it!

267
00:16:07,257 --> 00:16:09,301
Whoa. Who the heck was that girl?

268
00:16:13,806 --> 00:16:16,100
So what's the story
with you and that girl?

269
00:16:16,183 --> 00:16:17,851
Uh, a long one.

270
00:16:18,477 --> 00:16:20,396
She sure was pretty though, wasn't she?

271
00:16:20,479 --> 00:16:23,065
For real? Remember she's trying
to kill me, you idiot!

272
00:16:23,148 --> 00:16:24,900
- Yeah?
- Listen to me!

273
00:16:24,984 --> 00:16:25,985
Yeah?

274
00:16:30,197 --> 00:16:33,075
I'll never forget it.
It was a few months ago.

275
00:16:33,826 --> 00:16:35,202
So hungry.

276
00:16:35,285 --> 00:16:36,120
WHERE ARE WE GOING?

277
00:16:36,203 --> 00:16:37,955
This is the Chinese Amazon village.

278
00:16:38,038 --> 00:16:41,959
Chinese Amazons? What are they again?

279
00:16:42,042 --> 00:16:45,045
All of the women that come from
this village are incredibly strong.

280
00:16:45,129 --> 00:16:46,338
Oh.

281
00:16:46,422 --> 00:16:49,675
Oh, sounds like they're having
a contest today.

282
00:16:59,435 --> 00:17:03,105
Winning this martial arts contest is
quite the accomplishment.

283
00:17:03,188 --> 00:17:07,359
- Wow.
- I would say
that one girl's pretty strong.

284
00:17:09,653 --> 00:17:10,487
FIRST PRIZE

285
00:17:10,571 --> 00:17:12,614
So, uh, what do you two think
you're eating?

286
00:17:12,698 --> 00:17:14,324
Mmm? A meat bun?

287
00:17:14,408 --> 00:17:16,076
Hmm?

288
00:17:24,001 --> 00:17:27,379
She was saying, "What the hell?
Why does that girl and her panda believe

289
00:17:27,463 --> 00:17:29,590
they can start helping themselves
to my prize?"

290
00:17:29,673 --> 00:17:31,008
Your prize?

291
00:17:36,388 --> 00:17:38,891
She said, "It's the annual
martial arts contest,

292
00:17:38,974 --> 00:17:41,518
and I just won the fight
that declared me its champion."

293
00:17:41,602 --> 00:17:44,772
Well, if I beat you
then I guess you can't complain, right?

294
00:17:46,482 --> 00:17:48,150
Hmm.

295
00:17:53,113 --> 00:17:54,531
Aiyaa...

296
00:18:02,581 --> 00:18:05,000
Wow! She won immediately!

297
00:18:13,926 --> 00:18:14,927
What's up?

298
00:18:16,887 --> 00:18:18,347
Aiyaa!

299
00:18:18,430 --> 00:18:20,182
Whoa!

300
00:18:20,265 --> 00:18:22,518
I thought you said you were both girls
when this happened.

301
00:18:22,601 --> 00:18:24,144
Let me finish.

302
00:18:24,228 --> 00:18:25,562
Oh!

303
00:18:26,146 --> 00:18:27,147
Hmm.

304
00:18:30,901 --> 00:18:32,986
We have to run away! Now!

305
00:18:33,070 --> 00:18:34,321
Huh? But why?

306
00:18:34,404 --> 00:18:36,782
You've just become a recipient
of the Kiss of Death!

307
00:18:36,865 --> 00:18:38,325
What the heck is a Kiss of Death?

308
00:18:38,408 --> 00:18:41,078
The Chinese Amazons are
a very proud people.

309
00:18:43,247 --> 00:18:46,333
Losing to an outsider
is a dishonor worse than death.

310
00:18:48,043 --> 00:18:50,087
The Kiss of Death is a solemn vow,

311
00:18:50,170 --> 00:18:53,132
one that requires her
to chase you down to the depths of hell

312
00:18:53,215 --> 00:18:55,008
in pursuit of killing you.

313
00:19:00,055 --> 00:19:02,307
So that's
why she started following me.

314
00:19:02,391 --> 00:19:04,268
It didn't matter where I went in China,

315
00:19:04,351 --> 00:19:05,727
she was never far behind.

316
00:19:06,353 --> 00:19:08,397
Now she's followed you
all the way to Japan.

317
00:19:09,022 --> 00:19:10,732
Pretty impressive, huh, P-chan?

318
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:15,112
Well, it must be nice that
your assassin is a pretty, young girl.

319
00:19:15,195 --> 00:19:17,239
Really not wanting
that kind of consolation.

320
00:19:19,283 --> 00:19:20,284
I'm back.

321
00:19:20,367 --> 00:19:22,786
Hello, Ranma.
Someone's here to visit you.

322
00:19:23,787 --> 00:19:25,706
Oh, yeah? I wonder who it is.

323
00:19:27,666 --> 00:19:29,543
Mr. Saotome brought her in with him.

324
00:19:30,043 --> 00:19:31,378
Wha... Why?

325
00:19:31,461 --> 00:19:32,629
You freak-ass.

326
00:19:32,713 --> 00:19:35,299
What were you thinking, you crazy old man?

327
00:19:35,382 --> 00:19:37,092
SHE FOLLOWED ME

328
00:19:37,676 --> 00:19:38,927
Ranma?

329
00:19:40,220 --> 00:19:41,555
- Hmm.
- Hello.

330
00:19:41,638 --> 00:19:43,348
- Yeah. Uh.
- Hello.

331
00:19:46,602 --> 00:19:47,603
You're a man?

332
00:19:48,353 --> 00:19:51,857
Yeah, and, uh,
it's a real shame I'm not a girl.

333
00:19:51,940 --> 00:19:55,777
Oh! So this must be the first time
she's gotten to see you as a boy?

334
00:19:55,861 --> 00:19:57,362
Ryoga, you're back.

335
00:19:58,071 --> 00:20:01,283
How surprisingly perceptive
for you to notice, P-chan.

336
00:20:01,366 --> 00:20:04,620
Wha... You think you have the right
to talk to me like that, huh?

337
00:20:05,370 --> 00:20:08,290
Come on, man.
What crap are you trying to pull here?

338
00:20:08,373 --> 00:20:11,043
This nice lady came
all the way from China.

339
00:20:11,126 --> 00:20:12,586
Now be a girl for her.

340
00:20:14,922 --> 00:20:16,048
Give me Ranma.

341
00:20:16,131 --> 00:20:18,634
I don't know where she is!

342
00:20:18,717 --> 00:20:20,260
Ranma. She's here.

343
00:20:20,344 --> 00:20:22,554
You hide her. I kill you!

344
00:20:22,638 --> 00:20:24,431
Leave her alone.

345
00:20:24,514 --> 00:20:26,266
Argh. Don't get in my way!

346
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:28,602
Don't come in someone's house
to pick a fight!

347
00:20:34,024 --> 00:20:35,567
Well, that's no good.

348
00:20:35,651 --> 00:20:36,652
Poor girl.

349
00:20:36,735 --> 00:20:40,072
I guess this means she ended up losing
a second time.

350
00:20:41,698 --> 00:20:44,117
Uh, it was an accident!
I didn't do anything!

351
00:20:44,910 --> 00:20:48,956
There's no need for you to be so modest
about this, is there? You won the match.

352
00:20:49,039 --> 00:20:49,873
KNOCKOUT!!

353
00:20:49,957 --> 00:20:52,876
Well, yeah, but that was just...

354
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:57,339
So does this mean she's gonna be setting
her crosshairs on male Ranma too?

355
00:20:57,422 --> 00:20:58,674
Oh, no!

356
00:21:00,384 --> 00:21:02,344
This was all an accident
and you did not lose!

357
00:21:02,427 --> 00:21:03,762
Liar!

358
00:21:04,888 --> 00:21:07,391
Now accept your Kiss of Death
with some dignity.

359
00:21:09,810 --> 00:21:10,894
Hmm.

360
00:21:14,314 --> 00:21:15,399
Mmm? What?

361
00:21:15,482 --> 00:21:16,483
Wha...

362
00:21:25,993 --> 00:21:31,873
KISS OF DEATH
